{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52383","headline":"回波乐 二十六 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若能无着即如来，身中宝藏自然开。\n一切生死皆消灭，判不更畏受胞胎。\n悮（陈校作「悟」）时刹那不移虑，父子相见付珍财。\n衆魔外道皆宾仗（项校「伏」），诸天空中唱善哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}